{
    "title": "Norwegian Cruise Line",
    "description": "Get even more out of your vacation with more features, more control, and more simplicity - all in the palm of your hand.\r\n \r\nNorwegian Cruise Line\u2019s updated app makes it even easier to tailor your perfect vacation. Take full advantage of our endless experiences and wide variety of dining, entertainment, excursions, activities, and more.  See comprehensive onboard schedules, view extensive excursion details, browse updated menus, view entertainment listings, and make reservations for experiences onboard our ships and at our incredible destinations. Above all, prepare for your cruise with ease \u2013 your vacation begins the moment you board!  \r\n \r\nBEFORE YOU EMBARK\u2026\r\n \r\nDiscover your detailed itinerary with your pre-cruise planning checklist guiding you every step of the way. Make reservations for your favorite activities include excursions, entertainment, dining, and our exclusive Vibe Beach Club. Keep track of these activities with My Plans \u2013 outlining all of your vacation fun right at your fingertips. To speed up your boarding process, complete our simplified Online Check In experience. Get excited by counting down the days until you board one of our incredible Norwegian Ships!\r\n \r\nONCE ONBOARD\u2026\r\n \r\nConnect to the ship\u2019s complimentary internet to use the app free of charge. Keep track of your favorite activities by having the Freestyle Daily just a tap away! Hungry? Make new dining reservations and browse the menus of our incredible dining offerings. Explore our incredible destinations by booking one of our incredible shore excursions. Keep track of your daily expenses and purchases in real time. Reserve and enjoy are incredible entertainment offerings. Never miss an activity with My Plans keeping you up to date for your next great adventure.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get even more out of your vacation with more features, more control, and more simplicity - all in the palm of your hand.<br> <br>Norwegian Cruise Line\u2019s updated app makes it even easier to tailor your perfect vacation. Take full advantage of our endless experiences and wide variety of dining, entertainment, excursions, activities, and more.  See comprehensive onboard schedules, view extensive excursion details, browse updated menus, view entertainment listings, and make reservations for experiences onboard our ships and at our incredible destinations. Above all, prepare for your cruise with ease \u2013 your vacation begins the moment you board!  <br> <br>BEFORE YOU EMBARK\u2026<br> <br>Discover your detailed itinerary with your pre-cruise planning checklist guiding you every step of the way. Make reservations for your favorite activities include excursions, entertainment, dining, and our exclusive Vibe Beach Club. Keep track of these activities with My Plans \u2013 outlining all of your vacation fun right at your fingertips. To speed up your boarding process, complete our simplified Online Check In experience. Get excited by counting down the days until you board one of our incredible Norwegian Ships!<br> <br>ONCE ONBOARD\u2026<br> <br>Connect to the ship\u2019s complimentary internet to use the app free of charge. Keep track of your favorite activities by having the Freestyle Daily just a tap away! Hungry? Make new dining reservations and browse the menus of our incredible dining offerings. Explore our incredible destinations by booking one of our incredible shore excursions. Keep track of your daily expenses and purchases in real time. Reserve and enjoy are incredible entertainment offerings. Never miss an activity with My Plans keeping you up to date for your next great adventure.",
